# Overlays

OBS Browser Source is CEF (older Chromium). Keep overlays **vanilla HTML/CSS/JS**. No React/Vue build step.

- One folder per overlay: `public/overlays/<name>/{index.html,style.css,overlay.js}`.
- Transparent background. Connect to `/ws`. Reconnect with backoff.
- Render chat with `createElement` + `textContent`. Never `innerHTML` for user content.
- Emote/badge `src` must be `https:` URLs already resolved by the server.
- Put look-and-feel in CSS variables. Do not hardcode Twitch fetches in overlay JS.
- Handle `hello`, `chat.message`, `chat.message.delete`, and `chat.clear`. Ignore unknown `type`s so future events do not break chat.

```js
// BAD
text.innerHTML = payload.text

// GOOD
text.append(document.createTextNode(fragment.text))
```
